  "title": "Bring Your Sensible Head",
  "summary": "June's phone comes home. On it is a draft to Tess, written at 5:58 pm on the 12th and never sent, pointing to a green tin behind the preserves where \"both things\" are. Tess shares it with the family. Owen sets out a repayment plan, Glen's radiation begins in April, and Noah texts from his own number with June's chemistry notes. In the cellar Tess finds the second set of register copies, which Paul never found and which Cst. Morrison says makes the case. Under them is a sealed envelope addressed to Tess.",
